### Get all patients
GET http://localhost:3000/patients

###

### Get a single patient
GET http://localhost:3000/patients/PUT_ID_HERE

###

### Create a patient
POST http://localhost:3000/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "age": 30,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "+211912345678",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "diagnosis": "Malaria",
  "address": "Juba, South Sudan",
  "registeredDate": "2026-09-15",
  "emergencyContact": "+211987654321"
}

###

### Update a patient
PUT http://localhost:3000/patients/PUT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "age": 31,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "+211912345678",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "diagnosis": "Recovered",
  "address": "Juba, South Sudan",
  "registeredDate": "2026-09-15",
  "emergencyContact": "+211987654321"
}

###

### Delete a patient
DELETE http://localhost:3000/patients/PUT_ID_HERE